#, js-format
msgid "\"<strong></strong>\" is listed because %s was detected on your site, not because a scan saw the cookie. Removing it clears every cookie that service declares, here and on your cookie policy. If the service is still used anywhere on your site, it will be detected again and its cookies re-listed."
